    "transformer that scales numerical features and applies one-hot encoding\n",
    "to categorical features.\n",
    "\n",
    "**6. Model Definition:** An XGBoost classifier is defined with specific\n",
    "parameters, including the calculated class weight.\n",
    "\n",
