    "\n",
    "## **Actionable Insights and Recommendations**<a href=\"#Actionable-Insights-and-Recommendations\"\n",
    "class=\"anchor-link\">¶</a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Key Insights**<a href=\"#Key-Insights\" class=\"anchor-link\">¶</a>\n",
    "\n",
    "-   The XGBoost model achieved an F1 score of 0.78 and a recall of 0.95,\n",
    "    indicating strong capability to correctly detect engines that\n",
    "    require maintenance.\n",
    "\n",
    "-   Engine RPM, Lubricating Oil Pressure, and Coolant Temperature\n",
    "    emerged as the top three influential features contributing to\n",
    "    predictive maintenance decisions.\n",
    "\n",
    "-   High coolant and oil temperatures combined with abnormal pressure\n",
    "    readings are strong indicators of potential engine failure.\n",
    "\n",
    "-   The MLflow tracking framework ensured reproducibility and\n",
    "    transparency across all experiment runs, making it easier to monitor\n",
    "    performance improvements.\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Business Recommendations**<a href=\"#Business-Recommendations\" class=\"anchor-link\">¶</a>\n",
    "\n",
    "**1. Implement Real-Time Monitoring:** Integrate the trained model into\n",
    "the engine monitoring system to continuously predict and alert\n",
    "maintenance teams before failures occur.\n",
    "\n",
    "**2. Preventive Maintenance Scheduling**: Use model predictions to\n",
    "prioritize engine checks and optimize maintenance intervals, reducing\n",
    "downtime and repair costs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**3. Data-Driven Decision Making:** Continuously collect new sensor data\n",
    "to retrain the model, ensuring it adapts to changing conditions and\n",
    "maintains high accuracy.\n",
    "\n",
    "**4. Operational Efficiency:** Deploy the model via Streamlit on Hugging\n",
    "Face Spaces for interactive access by engineers and managers to\n",
    "visualize maintenance trends.\n",
    "\n",
    "**5. Automation and CI/CD:** Maintain continuous integration through\n",
    "GitHub Actions, ensuring any model updates or new data automatically\n",
    "retrigger the entire pipeline — from preprocessing to deployment.\n",
    "\n",
    "## **Conclusion**<a href=\"#Conclusion\" class=\"anchor-link\">¶</a>\n",
    "\n",
    "This Predictive Maintenance solution empowers the business to shift from\n",
    "reactive to proactive maintenance, minimizing engine failures, saving\n",
    "operational costs, and increasing asset lifespan through AI-driven\n",
    "insights."
